    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35101" root="قبض" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبْضَةٌ</span></b> : [pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبَضَاتٌ</span>:] see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبْضٌ</span>, in three places.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُبْضَةٌ</span>, in four places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْبِضٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Also, [The <i>measure of a man's fist,
from side to side;</i>] <i>four finger-breadths;</i> (Mgh,
Msb, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِيبٌ</span>;) the <i>sixth part of the common</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذِرَاع</span> [or cubit: but in the present day, the
<i>measure of a man's fist with the thumb erect;</i>
which is about <i>six inches and a quarter</i>]: pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبَضَاتٌ</span>. (Mgh, Msb, vocibus <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذِرَاعٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِيبٌ</span>.)

